<item>
            <title>[LU-20795] &apos;lfs find --printf&apos; incorrect sentinel handling during output formatting</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20795</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;%Lc and %LS print the internal default sentinel (1152921504606846978 or 0x1000000000000002, aka LLAPI_LAYOUT_DEFAULT) as a literal stripe count or stripe size, respectively.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;%Lo will treat the sentinel as a number of OSTs to iterate over and as a result fill the output buffer with &quot;?&quot; placeholders until truncation.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;%Li has a related error when the selected layout has no OST object entries.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
